perspective you're not seeing the perspective from&nbsp;
the other side and that was just again to sort of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:25.020
give give proper context to an educated audience&nbsp;
about about how to interpret and watch this film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:30.900
because essentially it was a story of a female&nbsp;
journalist who wanted to go over there and was&nbsp;&nbsp;

